Run the /v2/resolve vector search on the Spanner vector index.

A node_types filter inside the approximate nearest neighbour query makes
Spanner skip NodeEmbeddingIndex and compute the exact distance for every
row of NodeEmbedding. vectorSearchNode keeps only the null check and the
embedding label in the ANN query, reads 2 x @limit candidates, and applies
the threshold and node type filters in an outer query.

