+// vectorSearchCandidateFactor sets how many approximate nearest neighbours the
+// vector search reads per requested row. The index scan is approximate, so
+// reading only @limit candidates drops some of the exact top @limit; reading
+// twice as many reproduced the exact top 100 on the DFO graph. The surplus also
+// leaves room for rows the threshold and node type filters remove.
+const vectorSearchCandidateFactor = 2
+
